Alur section:

Nav: logo kiri, link ringan, tombol "Check Availability" kanan ( done )
Hero: foto penuh (Hero), headline + slogan, 1 CTA ke form ( done )
Trust strip: angka singkat (weddings planned, countries, rating) + logo venue ( done )
Problem: "Destination wedding shouldn't feel like a second job." 3 pain point pendek ( done)
Services: 3 paket (Full Planning, Partial Planning, Day-of Coordination) ( done)
Process: 3 langkah (Inquiry, Design call, Wedding day) ( done )
Gallery: grid foto wedding, 6 sampai 8 gambar
About: foto + cerita Mara, 1 paragraf ( done )
Testimonials: 3 kutipan pasangan
FAQ: 5 pertanyaan (budget, lokasi, timeline, deposit, revisi)
Final CTA + Form: nama, tanggal, lokasi, budget range, pesan
Footer: sosmed, email, copyright